insert into public.court_verdict_templates (
  case_id,outcome_key,headline,what_court_heard,verdict,court_ordered_move,share_text,tone_condition
) values
('CASE-001','spectrum_1','ICK-PRONE + ICK-PRONE','You''re both quick to clock an ick — cringe doesn''t get a grace period in this relationship.','No one''s wrong for having standards, but two trigger-happy ick detectors means small, harmless moments can get blown up into "are we still doing this" energy.','[username A] sentenced to: let one weird noise or dance move slide this week without commentary. [username B] sentenced to: same — pick your own moment to let it go. Do something intentionally cringe together on purpose — bad karaoke, a weird dance — and see if doing it as a team changes how ick it feels.','Bunny Court closed The Ick Trial.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('CASE-001','spectrum_2','ICK-PRONE + BALANCED','One of you clocks an ick fast. The other shrugs most things off — cringe just doesn''t land the same way for them.','Not really a mismatch, just different thresholds — the balanced partner has more patience to spare here.','[Ick-prone username] sentenced to: name what specifically triggered the ick instead of just going quiet about it. [Balanced username] sentenced to: notice when your partner side-eyes something, and don''t dismiss it as "you''re overreacting." Trade "things that lowkey ick me out" lists — you''ll probably both be surprised what''s on the other''s.','Bunny Court closed The Ick Trial.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('CASE-001','spectrum_3','ICK-PRONE + IMMUNE','One of you can clock an ick from a mile away. The other is basically immune — nothing registers as cringe to them.','This isn''t a compatibility problem, it''s a sensitivity gap — one of you notices small things, the other genuinely doesn''t see what the fuss is about.','[Ick-prone username] sentenced to: flag it lightly in the moment instead of stewing on it. [Immune username] sentenced to: take the flag seriously even if you don''t personally get it. Watch a so-bad-it''s-good movie together and rank the cringiest moments — see where your radars actually differ.','Bunny Court closed The Ick Trial.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('CASE-001','spectrum_4','BALANCED + BALANCED','Neither of you is particularly trigger-happy about cringe — you both let most things roll off.','Genuinely low-conflict territory here. The only risk is missing a real pattern because "it''s not that deep" becomes the default response to everything.','[username A] sentenced to: name one small thing that''s mildly bugged you, even if it''s not a big deal. [username B] sentenced to: actually take it seriously instead of laughing it off. Once a month, each name one tiny pet peeve — keeps small stuff from quietly piling up.','Bunny Court closed The Ick Trial.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('CASE-001','spectrum_5','BALANCED + IMMUNE','One of you is easygoing about most things. The other is basically un-ickable — truly nothing seems to register as cringe.','No conflict here — if anything, the court''s a little jealous of your combined immunity.','[Balanced username] sentenced to: point out one thing this week that''s mildly odd, just to keep the muscle. [Immune username] sentenced to: actually engage with it instead of "lol whatever." Try to ick each other out on purpose — see if you can even manage it.','Bunny Court closed The Ick Trial.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('CASE-001','spectrum_6','IMMUNE + IMMUNE','Neither of you gets the ick. Genuinely nothing seems to faze either of you.','The court has no notes. This might be the most emotionally durable relationship to ever appear in this courtroom.','[username A] sentenced to: do something deliberately weird this week just to test the limits. [username B] sentenced to: report back honestly if it actually worked. Compete to see who can out-weird the other — see if ick even exists between you two.','Bunny Court closed The Ick Trial.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('CASE-002','spectrum_1','DELULU + DELULU','You both read deep meaning into the smallest signals — a slow reply, an old-photo like, it''s all evidence in your shared theory of the relationship.','No harm in matching delulu energy — it''s giving main character syndrome for two — but building elaborate narratives off tiny clues means small misunderstandings can spiral fast.','[username A] sentenced to: fact-check one theory with your partner directly this week instead of running with it solo. [username B] sentenced to: same — your turn to reality-check a theory out loud. Share your current "delulu theory" about the relationship and see if the other one agrees or has a wildly different read.','Bunny Court closed Delulu Court.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('CASE-002','spectrum_2','DELULU + BALANCED','One of you finds meaning in every small gesture. The other notices some signals, shrugs off the rest.','Not a mismatch — the balanced partner just has a higher bar for what counts as "a sign," which can actually be a useful reality check.','[Delulu-leaning username] sentenced to: run your next big theory by your partner before fully committing to it. [Balanced username] sentenced to: don''t just dismiss it — engage with why they read it that way. Compare notes on one recent small moment — see where your interpretations actually diverge.','Bunny Court closed Delulu Court.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('CASE-002','spectrum_3','DELULU + GROUNDED','One of you sees a love story in every slow text reply. The other needs actual words before drawing any conclusions.','Neither read is wrong — one of you is wired to hope, the other to verify. The friction shows up when the delulu partner wants the grounded one to just "feel it," and the grounded partner wants fewer theories, more facts.','[Delulu-leaning username] sentenced to: say the actual thing out loud instead of hoping it''s understood through vibes. [Grounded username] sentenced to: entertain one romantic theory this week without immediately fact-checking it. Each share one hope you''ve been sitting on without saying it out loud — see how it lands when it''s actually said instead of implied.','Bunny Court closed Delulu Court.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('CASE-002','spectrum_4','BALANCED + BALANCED','Neither of you is spinning elaborate theories or demanding hard proof — you both read situations pretty reasonably.','This case barely needed a hearing. Just don''t let "reasonable" turn into "we never actually say what we mean."','[username A] sentenced to: say one genuinely soft, undefended thing this week. [username B] sentenced to: receive it without deflecting into a joke. Take turns saying one true, slightly vulnerable thing about how you feel about the relationship right now.','Bunny Court closed Delulu Court.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('CASE-002','spectrum_5','BALANCED + GROUNDED','One of you reads situations fairly evenly. The other needs pretty clear evidence before believing anything romantic.','No real conflict — the grounded partner just needs more explicit reassurance than most, and the balanced partner can usually provide it without much effort.','[Balanced username] sentenced to: say things a little more directly this week, skip the subtlety. [Grounded username] sentenced to: accept a plain statement at face value instead of looking for the catch. Practice saying one thing plainly, no hedging, no "I don''t know, maybe" — and just let it land.','Bunny Court closed Delulu Court.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('CASE-002','spectrum_6','GROUNDED + GROUNDED','Neither of you reads much into small gestures — you both need it said plainly before you believe it.','Very low-drama pairing here. The only risk is under-communicating, since neither of you fills in the blanks for the other.','[username A] sentenced to: say one thing directly this week that you''d normally assume was obvious. [username B] sentenced to: same — your turn to state the obvious out loud. Take turns saying exactly what you''re thinking, no interpretation needed — see how refreshing (or funny) total clarity feels.','Bunny Court closed Delulu Court.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('CASE-003','spectrum_1','HARD-LAUNCH + HARD-LAUNCH','You''re both ready to post — the only debate left is whose grid the couple pic goes on first.','No mismatch here, just two people excited to make it main-page official.','[username A] sentenced to: pick the caption this week, no overthinking it. [username B] sentenced to: veto power on one (1) unflattering photo, max. Do the joint hard launch this week — full send, no soft launch detour.','Bunny Court closed Soft Launch vs Hard Launch.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('CASE-003','spectrum_2','HARD-LAUNCH + BALANCED','One of you is ready to post loud and proud. The other''s fine either way, no strong feelings on timing.','Not a conflict — the balanced partner has room to say yes to the hard launch without it costing them much.','[Hard-launch-leaning username] sentenced to: stop hinting and just ask directly if they''re ready to post. [Balanced username] sentenced to: say yes if you''re actually fine with it, instead of "we''ll see." Pick one photo together this week that you''d both be happy to post, official or not.','Bunny Court closed Soft Launch vs Hard Launch.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('CASE-003','spectrum_3','HARD-LAUNCH + SOFT-LAUNCH/PRIVATE','One of you is ready to go Instagram official. The other prefers keeping things a little more private, at least for now.','Wanting to post isn''t more "serious" than wanting privacy — some people show love in public, some show it by keeping it just between the two of you.','[Hard-launch-leaning username] sentenced to: let go of the "why won''t they post me" spiral for now. [Private-leaning username] sentenced to: share an actual reason (not just "I don''t know") for wanting to keep it low-key. Agree on one small public gesture that feels okay to both of you — even a soft launch counts as progress.','Bunny Court closed Soft Launch vs Hard Launch.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('CASE-003','spectrum_4','BALANCED + BALANCED','Neither of you is pushing for a public post or hiding the relationship — you''re both just letting it happen naturally.','Genuinely no drama here. The court has nothing to add.','[username A] sentenced to: post one (1) low-stakes couple photo this month, purely for the plot. [username B] sentenced to: caption it. Take a cute photo together this week — post it or don''t, no pressure either way.','Bunny Court closed Soft Launch vs Hard Launch.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('CASE-003','spectrum_5','BALANCED + SOFT-LAUNCH/PRIVATE','One of you doesn''t feel strongly either way. The other genuinely prefers to keep things more private.','Low-conflict gap — the balanced partner can easily lean toward privacy without giving anything up.','[Balanced username] sentenced to: stop bringing up posting if it''s clearly not their thing. [Private-leaning username] sentenced to: share one small thing publicly, even just a soft launch, as a middle ground. Agree on what "public" even means for you two — a story, a post, a bio update — pick one small step.','Bunny Court closed Soft Launch vs Hard Launch.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('CASE-003','spectrum_6','SOFT-LAUNCH/PRIVATE + SOFT-LAUNCH/PRIVATE','Neither of you is in a rush to post — you''re both perfectly happy keeping this between you two.','No conflict, no need to perform the relationship for anyone else. That''s valid.','[username A] sentenced to: make sure "private" doesn''t quietly become "we never celebrate this out loud together." [username B] sentenced to: same. Do something to mark the relationship just for the two of you — no camera required.','Bunny Court closed Soft Launch vs Hard Launch.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('CASE-021','spectrum_1','LITERAL + LITERAL','When you two say "Netflix and chill," you mean it — actual Netflix, actual chilling, credits rolling before anyone falls asleep.','No miscommunication here. Somewhat wholesome, honestly.','[username A] sentenced to: pick tonight''s movie. [username B] sentenced to: no phone scrolling through the whole thing. Actually finish a movie together this week, start to finish, no distractions.','Bunny Court closed The "Netflix and Chill" Definition Trial.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('CASE-021','spectrum_2','LITERAL + BALANCED','One of you means it literally every time. The other''s more "we''ll see how the night goes."','Not a real conflict — the balanced partner can go either way depending on the vibe.','[Literal-leaning username] sentenced to: actually pick a movie you''re excited about, not just background noise. [Balanced username] sentenced to: commit to finishing it once you start. Pick a movie you''ve both been wanting to watch and actually watch the whole thing this week.','Bunny Court closed The "Netflix and Chill" Definition Trial.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('CASE-021','spectrum_3','LITERAL + EUPHEMISM','One of you genuinely means "let''s watch a movie." The other reads it as code for something else entirely.','Classic crossed wires — nobody''s wrong, the phrase just carries two different meanings depending who''s saying it.','[Literal-leaning username] sentenced to: just say "let''s actually watch a movie" if that''s what you mean. [Euphemism-leaning username] sentenced to: same energy — say what you''re actually hoping for. Next time, say the plan out loud before hitting play — saves everyone the confusion.','Bunny Court closed The "Netflix and Chill" Definition Trial.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('CASE-021','spectrum_4','BALANCED + BALANCED','Neither of you has a fixed idea of what "Netflix and chill" means — you both just go with whatever the night brings.','Low-stakes, no notes.','[username A] sentenced to: pick the show this time. [username B] sentenced to: no complaining about the pick. Let tonight be whatever it turns into, no expectations set in advance.','Bunny Court closed The "Netflix and Chill" Definition Trial.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('CASE-021','spectrum_5','BALANCED + EUPHEMISM','One of you is flexible about what the night turns into. The other''s pretty clear on what they''re actually hoping for.','Easy overlap — the balanced partner has room to meet the other''s expectations without much friction.','[Balanced username] sentenced to: ask what they''re actually in the mood for before assuming "movie." [Euphemism-leaning username] sentenced to: just say it plainly instead of hinting through movie invites. Skip the code phrase for one night — just say what you''re both actually up for.','Bunny Court closed The "Netflix and Chill" Definition Trial.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('CASE-021','spectrum_6','EUPHEMISM + EUPHEMISM','You both know exactly what "Netflix and chill" means in this relationship, and it''s rarely about the movie.','No miscommunication here — you''re both fluent in the same code.','[username A] sentenced to: actually pick a real movie once this month, just to keep the tradition alive. [username B] sentenced to: watch at least 20 minutes of it. Try an actual movie night for once — see if you even remember how it goes.','Bunny Court closed The "Netflix and Chill" Definition Trial.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('CASE-011','spectrum_1','HIGH + HIGH','You both live for the daily good morning/goodnight text — missing one genuinely throws off the whole day.','You''re aligned here, which means the ritual actually works both ways instead of feeling one-sided.','[username A] sentenced to: keep it up, no slacking. [username B] sentenced to: same. Switch it up this week — send something other than "good morning," just to keep the ritual fresh.','Bunny Court closed The "Good Morning Text" Verdict.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('CASE-011','spectrum_2','HIGH + BALANCED','One of you needs that daily text to feel connected. The other''s fine whether it happens or not.','Not really a conflict — the balanced partner can easily keep the habit going without it costing them much.','[Ritual-high username] sentenced to: say plainly that this ritual actually matters to you, instead of hoping they notice. [Balanced username] sentenced to: keep the streak going even on days you forget it matters. Set a recurring reminder for one week and see how it feels to make it automatic.','Bunny Court closed The "Good Morning Text" Verdict.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('CASE-011','spectrum_3','HIGH + LOW','One of you needs the daily good morning text to feel like the relationship''s on track. The other genuinely doesn''t think about it much either way.','Neither of you is wrong — one of you shows up through small daily rituals, the other shows up in bigger, less frequent ways.','[Ritual-high username] sentenced to: name specifically what the text means to you, not just that you want it. [Ritual-low username] sentenced to: set a phone reminder if that''s what it takes — habit over instinct is fine. Try the daily text for one week straight and see if it changes anything for either of you.','Bunny Court closed The "Good Morning Text" Verdict.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('CASE-011','spectrum_4','BALANCED + BALANCED','Neither of you is hung up on the daily text — you both show love in other ways, and that''s worked out fine.','No conflict, no notes.','[username A] sentenced to: send one out-of-nowhere text this week just because. [username B] sentenced to: same. Surprise each other with a random check-in text sometime this week — no pattern, no pressure.','Bunny Court closed The "Good Morning Text" Verdict.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('CASE-011','spectrum_5','BALANCED + LOW','One of you doesn''t have strong feelings about texting rituals. The other genuinely doesn''t need them either.','No tension here, this pairing just runs on different, less-scheduled affection.','[username A] sentenced to: check in once this week with something more than a one-word text. [username B] sentenced to: same. Plan one intentional "we''re thinking about each other" moment this week, in whatever form actually feels natural to you two.','Bunny Court closed The "Good Morning Text" Verdict.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('CASE-011','spectrum_6','LOW + LOW','Neither of you is big on daily texting rituals — you both just don''t need it to feel secure.','No conflict, this works fine for plenty of couples.','[username A] sentenced to: send one text today, purely to keep the court entertained. [username B] sentenced to: reply with more than "lol." Try one genuinely unprompted "thinking of you" text this week, just to see how it lands.','Bunny Court closed The "Good Morning Text" Verdict.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('CASE-018','spectrum_1','HIGH + HIGH','You''re both fully comfortable being visibly affectionate — hand-holding, PDA, the works, no hesitation.','No mismatch here — just two people who like showing it.','[username A] sentenced to: keep it PG in professional settings, just a gentle reminder. [username B] sentenced to: same. Go somewhere public this week and be exactly as affectionate as you naturally want to be.','Bunny Court closed PDA on Main Trial.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('CASE-018','spectrum_2','HIGH + BALANCED','One of you is naturally affectionate in public. The other''s comfortable with it, just not as instinctively.','Not a conflict — the balanced partner has plenty of room to lean into it without discomfort.','[High-comfort username] sentenced to: read the room before going full PDA in more formal settings. [Balanced username] sentenced to: initiate the hand-hold once this week instead of waiting. Take a walk together this week, hands held the whole way, no reason needed.','Bunny Court closed PDA on Main Trial.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('CASE-018','spectrum_3','HIGH + LOW','One of you is naturally affectionate in public. The other prefers to keep that side of the relationship more private.','Neither preference means less love — one of you shows it outwardly, the other just prefers to keep it between the two of you. Public affection isn''t a scoreboard.','[High-comfort username] sentenced to: dial it back in settings where your partner''s visibly uncomfortable. [Low-comfort username] sentenced to: offer a small public gesture, even if it''s just holding hands, as a middle ground. Agree on one specific type of public affection that feels okay to both of you, and stick to that as your baseline.','Bunny Court closed PDA on Main Trial.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('CASE-018','spectrum_4','BALANCED + BALANCED','Neither of you has strong feelings about PDA either way — you''re affectionate when it feels natural, reserved when it doesn''t.','No conflict, genuinely well-matched here.','[username A] sentenced to: initiate one small public gesture this week. [username B] sentenced to: reciprocate without overthinking it. Go on a date this week and just let affection happen naturally, no rules either way.','Bunny Court closed PDA on Main Trial.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('CASE-018','spectrum_5','BALANCED + LOW','One of you doesn''t feel strongly about PDA. The other genuinely prefers to keep things low-key in public.','Low-friction gap — the balanced partner has room to respect that preference without giving much up.','[Balanced username] sentenced to: don''t take it personally when PDA doesn''t happen. [Low-comfort username] sentenced to: offer one small gesture occasionally, even briefly. Find one private way to be affectionate that doesn''t require being in public at all.','Bunny Court closed PDA on Main Trial.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('CASE-018','spectrum_6','LOW + LOW','Neither of you is big on public affection — you''re both more reserved about that side of the relationship in front of others.','No conflict, this is just how you two operate, and it works.','[username A] sentenced to: one small, low-key gesture in public this week, just to keep the muscle. [username B] sentenced to: same. Save the affection for when it''s just the two of you — plan one at-home date this week that''s just about closeness.','Bunny Court closed PDA on Main Trial.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('CASE-014','spectrum_1','ACTION + ACTION','You both show love the same way — by doing, not saying. Words rarely make it out loud in this relationship; actions do all the talking.','No mismatch here — you''re fluent in the same love language. The only risk is assuming the other already knows how you feel, since neither of you says it much.','[username A] sentenced to: say "I love you" (or something like it) out loud once this week — no action attached. [username B] sentenced to: same sentence, different day. Say it first, before doing anything about it. Tonight, take turns saying one thing you appreciate about the other — out loud, no doing-something-about-it allowed.','Bunny Court closed Love Language Mismatch Trial.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('CASE-014','spectrum_2','ACTION + BALANCED','One of you shows love mostly through doing. The other''s a bit of both — sometimes it''s the gesture, sometimes it''s the words.','This isn''t really a mismatch, more like one of you needs a translator sometimes. The balanced partner can usually read both languages — the action partner might just need reminding that words still land.','[Action-leaning username] sentenced to: say the thing out loud once this week, not just do it. [Balanced username] sentenced to: name it out loud when an action really landed — "that meant a lot" goes a long way. Pick one day this week to swap roles — the doer says it instead, the balanced one does something instead of saying it.','Bunny Court closed Love Language Mismatch Trial.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('CASE-014','spectrum_3','ACTION + WORDS（已确认案例）','You feel most loved when someone shows up and does the thing. They feel most loved when someone says the thing out loud.','This isn''t a mismatch of love, it''s a mismatch of frequency — you''re both sending love, just on different channels. No translator error is a crime here.','[Action-leaning username] sentenced to: one small act of service this week, no questions asked. [Words-leaning username] sentenced to: send one out-of-the-blue "I appreciate you" text this week. Tonight, each of you name one thing the other did this week that actually made you feel loved — bonus points if they didn''t even mean it as a "love language" move.','Bunny Court closed Love Language Mismatch Trial.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('CASE-014','spectrum_4','BALANCED + BALANCED','You''re both fluent in doing and saying — this case almost didn''t need to go to court.','Genuinely, no complaints filed. The court just wants to make sure you keep mixing it up instead of coasting on "we''re fine."','[username A] sentenced to: one specific, over-the-top act of appreciation this week — your choice, words or action. [username B] sentenced to: same, but it has to be a surprise. Take turns guessing what the other did for you before they tell you — see how well you actually know each other''s moves.','Bunny Court closed Love Language Mismatch Trial.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('CASE-014','spectrum_5','BALANCED + WORDS','One of you can flex both love languages depending on the day. The other really needs to hear it — actions alone don''t always land the same way.','The balanced partner has more range here, which means a little more of the reaching-out falls on them — not because it''s fair, but because it''s easier for them to bridge the gap.','[Balanced username] sentenced to: say it out loud this week, even when you''d normally just do something instead. [Words-leaning username] sentenced to: name one action from this week that actually did feel like love, even if no one said anything. End the day with one sentence each — what made you feel loved today, said instead of shown.','Bunny Court closed Love Language Mismatch Trial.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('CASE-014','spectrum_6','WORDS + WORDS','Neither of you is short on words — this relationship runs on "I love you"s and check-ins. Actions might be the thing that occasionally slips.','No shortage of affirmation here — the court''s only note is that words are easy to say and easy to forget follow-through on. Backing it up occasionally doesn''t hurt.','[username A] sentenced to: do one small thing for [username B] this week without announcing it first. [username B] sentenced to: same — your turn to surprise them quietly. See who can slip in an unannounced kind gesture first — no credit until the other one notices.','Bunny Court closed Love Language Mismatch Trial.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('LOVE-04','mutual_receipts','MUTUAL RECEIPTS','The evidence table is crowded with tiny, unglamorous green flags: remembered details, useful favors, and showing up without a parade.','You are not missing the care; you are actually catching it in real time. The Court finds a mutual sweetheart operation with unusually good receipt retention.','`[username A]` names one recent thing `[username B]` did that made life lighter. `[username B]` returns one equally specific receipt—no “you’re just great” generalities. Start a three-line “keep doing this” note and add one receipt each this week.','No gold star required. The effort was already on the record.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('LOVE-04','different_subtitles','DIFFERENT SUBTITLES','Care is happening on both sides, but one person reads actions while the other waits for words, time, or a clearer signal.','Nobody failed the green-flag audit. Your care simply arrived with different subtitles, and one translation setting needs switching on.','The action-first partner says what one gesture meant instead of assuming it was obvious. The words-or-time partner points out one action that did land before asking for more. Each finish: “I feel chosen when you…” with one behavior the other can actually repeat.','Same care package, different notification settings.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('LOVE-04','care_needs_daylight','CARE NEEDS DAYLIGHT','At least one of you has been squinting at the evidence. Care may exist, but lately it has been too faint, too assumed, or aimed at the wrong target.','The Court will not award points for invisible effort nobody can feel. This is a visibility problem, not proof that love is absent.','The person asking for more chooses one small, doable signal—not a total personality renovation. The other completes that exact signal once this week and checks whether it landed. Pick one seven-day experiment from the answers, then review it without scoring the whole relationship.','Green flag located. Please move it into better lighting. ---','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('LOVE-05','protected_weirdness','PROTECTED WEIRDNESS','The alleged offense is weird, specific, and apparently part of the charm. Both witnesses seem more entertained than harmed.','The Court classifies this as protected relationship wildlife. No correction is required; occasional affectionate roasting remains permitted.','`[username A]` publicly defends one harmless quirk of `[username B]`. `[username B]` admits one of `[username A]`’s odd habits has become weirdly comforting. Name your relationship’s three most legally protected bits.','A little weird has been declared an essential habitat.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('LOVE-05','one_person_fan_club','ONE-PERSON FAN CLUB','One person is committed to the bit. The other has been smiling with the energy of someone waiting for a meeting to end.','This is not a ban-worthy offense, but enthusiasm is not transferable by force. The quirk may continue with a volume knob.','The quirk owner learns the difference between a real laugh and a mercy laugh. The tolerant partner gives one honest cue before annoyance becomes a surprise verdict. Choose where the bit is always welcome, sometimes welcome, and absolutely off duty.','The joke may stay. Its unlimited data plan has been revoked.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('LOVE-05','user_manual_required','USER MANUAL REQUIRED','What looked beige from one seat lands much louder from the other. Repetition, setting, or impact has moved it out of harmless-chaos territory.','Intent can be innocent while impact still asks for a change. The Court orders specificity instead of “you’re too sensitive” versus “you’re always annoying.”','The affected partner names the exact setting or repetition that crosses the line. The quirk owner agrees to one concrete adjustment without demanding a closing argument. Write the smallest possible workaround and test it for a week.','Quirk preserved where possible; dignity preserved everywhere. ---','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('LOVE-06','same_clock','SAME CLOCK','Your reply expectations live in roughly the same time zone. Neither person is building a conspiracy board between messages.','The Court finds no response-time crisis. Keep the rhythm; just do not let comfort turn every message into “lol yeah.”','`[username A]` sends one message this week that contains an actual thought. `[username B]` responds without making the conversation carry itself. Trade one voice note or properly formed sentence on a busy day.','The typing bubble may stand down.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('LOVE-06','fast_lane_slow_lane','FAST LANE / SLOW LANE','One person experiences a text as an open conversational tab. The other treats it like mail that will be handled during business hours.','Different clocks are not different levels of care. The preventable part is making one person guess which clock is running today.','The slower replier sends a short “busy, back later” signal when possible. The faster replier saves follow-up messages for new information, not escalating punctuation. Pick one shared status phrase that means “still us, currently occupied.”','Delayed, not denied.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('LOVE-06','silence_has_acquired_lore','SILENCE HAS ACQUIRED LORE','The wait is no longer just a wait; it now arrives carrying old interpretations, screenshots, and a full imaginary soundtrack.','The Court cannot make anyone permanently available. It can require a clearer distinction between busy, needing space, and avoiding a conversation.','The person going offline states which of those three is true and, when possible, when they will return. The waiting partner asks once for clarity instead of prosecuting the silence in real time. Agree on a maximum “no-context gap” for ordinary days and a different rule for conflict.','Read receipts remain inadmissible without context. ---','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('LOVE-07','mutual_attachment_enthusiasts','MUTUAL ATTACHMENT ENTHUSIASTS','Both of you are apparently allergic to acting nonchalant. The check-ins are frequent, reciprocal, and not currently under protest.','The Court declines to criminalize enjoying your favorite person. Mutual cling is simply a shared hobby when nobody is being crowded.','`[username A]` initiates one no-reason check-in. `[username B]` chooses the next small reunion ritual. Invent a two-minute “back together” routine for ordinary days.','Personal space remains available by request, not by rumor.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('LOVE-07','different_contact_appetites','DIFFERENT CONTACT APPETITES','One of you reaches for connection more often. The other is equally attached but does not need the relationship tab open all day.','This is a dosage difference, not a love ranking. A little predictability can keep affection from feeling like pursuit or indifference.','The higher-contact partner asks for one specific ritual instead of unlimited access. The lower-contact partner initiates that ritual before being reminded. Choose one dependable check-in and leave the rest flexible.','Different notification settings, same favorite contact.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('LOVE-07','affection_needs_consent_settings','AFFECTION NEEDS CONSENT SETTINGS','Contact has started landing as pressure for one person and uncertainty for the other. Both are reacting to the feeling underneath, not just the number of texts.','More contact cannot manufacture security, and less contact cannot communicate a boundary nobody named. The next move is a mutually legible rhythm.','The crowded partner names when and how they can reconnect. The anxious partner respects that window and says what reassurance would help without demanding live tracking. Make a three-part plan: welcome anytime, ask first, and offline time.','Closeness approved. Compulsory attendance denied. ---','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('LOVE-09','shared_starter_energy','SHARED STARTER ENERGY','The first text, first plan, and first little bid for attention move back and forth without a project manager.','The cute stuff is shared. The Court recommends protecting this rare natural resource from calendar chaos and complacency.','`[username A]` starts one thing in `[username B]`’s favorite format. `[username B]` initiates a different kind of connection the same week. Each secretly plan one tiny moment, then reveal them on different days.','Initiative has joint custody.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('LOVE-09','one_carries_the_starter_pistol','ONE CARRIES THE STARTER PISTOL','One person opens most doors to connection. The other usually walks through happily, but rarely reaches the handle first.','Responsiveness is valuable, but it does not feel identical to being actively chosen. The quieter initiator has one small turn to take.','The frequent initiator stops filling one predictable gap this week. The usual responder notices the opening and starts a plan or conversation before it becomes a test. Alternate who initiates your next two shared plans.','Starter pistol transferred without injury.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('LOVE-09','two_different_scoreboards','TWO DIFFERENT SCOREBOARDS','Both people believe they are doing more, which means invisible labor and different definitions have entered the evidence room.','You may be counting different currencies: texts, planning, affection, or repair. The Court orders a shared scoreboard with fewer columns.','Each person names two initiations they count and one they have overlooked from the other. Then each takes ownership of one recurring bid. Choose one weekly plan and one daily micro-check-in, with named starters.','The spreadsheet was denied. Two clear examples were admitted. ---','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('LOVE-10','two_leads_no_filler_episode','TWO LEADS, NO FILLER EPISODE','You trade the spotlight without turning support into a competition. The plot has two leads and surprisingly functional writers.','Main-character energy is not the offense; forgetting the co-star would be. No such evidence was found today.','`[username A]` directs one tiny cinematic moment for `[username B]`. `[username B]` returns the favor in a completely different genre. Make an ordinary errand unnecessarily cinematic—playlist, outfits, dramatic arrival optional.','The NPC allegation has been dismissed with prejudice.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('LOVE-10','lead_plus_executive_producer','LEAD PLUS EXECUTIVE PRODUCER','One person supplies more spectacle. The other stabilizes, hypes, photographs, or quietly gets everyone home.','Different roles can be excellent casting when both are chosen. The producer still deserves a scene with their name above the title.','The frequent lead asks what kind of moment the supporter wants next. The supporter chooses it without downsizing the request into “whatever.” Plan one date around the quieter person’s taste from start to finish.','Supporting actor promoted. Catering remains shared.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('LOVE-10','someone_got_edited_out','SOMEONE GOT EDITED OUT','One person’s stories, moods, or plans have been taking up the frame while the other keeps getting the reaction shot.','Attention is not a fixed resource, but it does require turn-taking. The Court orders less accidental monologue and more actual co-starring.','The spotlight-holder asks one follow-up and does not redirect the answer. The sidelined partner names one moment they want witnessed, plainly and without apologizing. Take ten uninterrupted minutes each to share something current; listener only asks questions.','Both names restored to the poster. ---','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('LOVE-11','shared_dj_citizenship','SHARED DJ CITIZENSHIP','Your queue survives both taste tests. Skips are rare, bangers are acknowledged, and nobody is secretly reaching for Bluetooth settings.','The Court recognizes a functioning musical democracy. Continue with only the normal amount of dramatic song ownership.','`[username A]` adds one song that reminds them of `[username B]`. `[username B]` adds one surprise pick with no defensive preamble. Build a six-song “us, no skips” playlist—three picks each.','No skips were harmed in the making of this ruling.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('LOVE-11','different_taste_workable_treaty','DIFFERENT TASTE, WORKABLE TREATY','Your genres may never share a festival stage, but both people are willing to stop treating taste as a moral achievement.','Compatibility does not require identical playlists. It requires a rotation that does not make either passenger feel trapped in someone else’s algorithm.','The frequent DJ gives the other the first twenty uninterrupted minutes next ride. The second DJ chooses for shared mood, not revenge. Make a three-zone queue: yours, mine, and songs neither person is allowed to complain about.','Musical differences remain; civil order restored.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('LOVE-11','aux_dictatorship','AUX DICTATORSHIP','One person has been controlling the queue while the other’s picks receive immediate vetoes, jokes, or suspiciously timed “accidental” skips.','The aux cord is a shared public utility. Taste may be judged privately; access must be distributed publicly.','The current aux monarch completes one full ride without touching the skip button. The underrepresented listener prepares a reasonable-length set, not a six-hour retaliation mix. Flip a coin for first pick, then alternate exactly five songs.','The cord has been returned to civilian control. ---','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('LOVE-12','ready_to_define','READY TO DEFINE','Both testimonies point past casual, and the only remaining obstacle appears to be saying the sentence out loud.','The Court cannot assign a label for you, but it can note that mutual clarity is already knocking. Open the door like adults with excellent chemistry.','`[username A]` says what commitment means in behavior, not just title. `[username B]` states the label and next step they are genuinely available for. Hold a twenty-minute definition talk with three topics: exclusivity, expectations, and what changes tomorrow.','Ambiguity has lost its squatter’s rights.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('LOVE-12','same_connection_different_speed','SAME CONNECTION, DIFFERENT SPEED','Both people value the connection, but one is reaching for definition while the other is still checking the map.','A slower pace is not rejection, and urgency is not automatically pressure. The fair outcome is a real checkpoint, not indefinite “let’s see.”','The faster-moving partner names the minimum clarity they need now. The slower-moving partner gives an honest timeline and the information they still need—without offering a placeholder promise. Set one date to revisit the conversation and one behavior that applies until then.','The appeal remains open; the calendar now contains evidence.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('LOVE-12','different_destinations','DIFFERENT DESTINATIONS','One person wants a defined relationship. The other wants casual, undefined, or something materially different.','Chemistry cannot negotiate incompatible availability on your behalf. The kind ruling is clarity before either person invests against their own stated needs.','Each person states what they can offer without softening it to preserve the moment. Each then decides based on the actual offer, not its imagined sequel. Compare “what I want,” “what I can offer,” and “what would hurt me to continue.”','No villain found. Two destinations entered into the record. ---','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('LOVE-15','consensual_lore','CONSENSUAL LORE','The group chat received a harmless episode and both lead actors approved distribution.','The Court permits relationship lore when consent is part of the production budget. Keep the friends; keep the inside moments that are only yours.','`[username A]` identifies one category that is always safe to share. `[username B]` identifies one category that stays off the timeline even when funny. Make a quick green/yellow/red sharing list.','The group chat remains on supervised visitation.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('LOVE-15','different_privacy_defaults','DIFFERENT PRIVACY DEFAULTS','One person thought they were telling a funny story. The other discovered their private life had acquired an audience.','Nobody needs a secrecy contract, but “I would not mind” is not the same as permission. Your default settings need one joint update.','The sharer asks before screenshots or conflict details next time. The more private partner names what is okay instead of issuing a total media blackout after the fact. Agree on one ask-first phrase that takes five seconds and prevents a sequel.','Context added; forwarding privileges revised.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('LOVE-15','privacy_line_crossed','PRIVACY LINE CROSSED','The shared material was vulnerable, intimate, identifying, or clearly outside one person’s comfort.','A laugh or request for advice does not outweigh the other person’s privacy. Repair requires ownership, containment, and a rule that does not depend on guessing.','The sharer acknowledges the specific impact and asks recipients to delete or stop circulating the material where possible. The exposed partner states the future boundary and what repair would help now. Write a one-sentence rule covering screenshots, intimacy, and conflict details.','The evidence is sealed. The lesson may remain public to the two of you. ---','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('LOVE-16','mutually_approved_nonsense','MUTUALLY APPROVED NONSENSE','The offense was unserious, the retaliation proportionate, and both parties appear annoyingly pleased with themselves.','The Court recognizes consensual pettiness as recreational relationship theatre. Cleanup remains mandatory.','`[username A]` restores anything moved, hidden, or mildly sabotaged. `[username B]` retires the bit before it becomes a franchise. Invent one prank-free rematch: trivia, snack ranking, or dramatic roast with agreed limits.','The whoopee cushion may remain in evidence.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('LOVE-16','petty_with_a_message','PETTY WITH A MESSAGE','The joke contained a tiny folded note reading, “I am actually annoyed.” Unfortunately, nobody opened the note.','Petty moves are efficient at getting attention and terrible at communicating the request. The Court orders the subtext promoted to text.','The retaliator names the original annoyance without defending the stunt. The recipient responds to the request before reviewing the comedic execution. Replace the next petty impulse with: “I am tempted to be annoying because I need…”','Motive discovered under several layers of nonsense.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('LOVE-16','conflict_in_costume','CONFLICT IN COSTUME','One person did not experience the act as playful. The retaliation was meant to sting, embarrass, punish, or test a limit.','If only one person is laughing, the bit has ended. The underlying conflict deserves a direct conversation without bonus damage.','The person who acted owns the impact and stops the behavior. The affected partner states the boundary and the unresolved issue separately so neither gets lost. Take a pause, then discuss only the original issue and one repair for the retaliation.','Comedy license suspended pending mutual laughter. ---','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('LOVE-17','mutual_night_shift','MUTUAL NIGHT SHIFT','Both parties understand the bat signal and willingly report for duty. No one is pretending midnight is noon.','The Court finds a consensual late-night communications department. Keep clarity nearby in case the job description changes.','`[username A]` sends the next message with an actual invitation attached. `[username B]` answers honestly instead of performing strategic sleep. Plan one spontaneous late-night thing that is not just scrolling in separate rooms.','Court adjourned until unreasonable waking hours.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('LOVE-17','daylight_requested','DAYLIGHT REQUESTED','One person enjoys the late-night spark but would also like proof they exist before the moon clocks in.','The message is not the crime. A connection that only appears after hours can start feeling like a side entrance.','The frequent sender makes one daylight plan with time and place. The receiver says which kind of spontaneous contact still feels fun rather than dismissing all of it. Pair one unplanned night with one properly planned day.','Daylight access granted.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('LOVE-17','availability_mismatch','AVAILABILITY MISMATCH','The message means casual access to one person and emotional possibility to the other—or it arrives after a boundary has already been implied.','Vibes cannot carry incompatible expectations forever. The Court orders the invitation translated into plain language before anyone answers it.','The sender states what they are actually offering. The receiver states what they are available for and declines what does not fit without bargaining against themselves. Compare the sentence you sent, the meaning you intended, and the meaning received.','“You up?” has been ordered to provide context. ---','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('LOVE-18','cosmic_co_sign','COSMIC CO-SIGN','The charts are present, the jokes are mutual, and nobody has been denied due process for being a Gemini.','Astrology may continue as relationship seasoning. Actual behavior remains the main course and primary evidence.','`[username A]` names one chart observation that genuinely helped them understand `[username B]`. `[username B]` names one thing the chart could never know. Read one compatibility claim and compare it with your real receipts.','Mercury has been informed and has no further comment.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('LOVE-18','believer_spectator_pairing','BELIEVER / SPECTATOR PAIRING','One person brings the chart; the other brings an affectionate “sure, babe.” Both remain in the room voluntarily.','Different belief levels are harmless when curiosity moves both ways. Respect does not require pretending to share certainty.','The astrology fan asks before giving a cosmic explanation for the other person. The spectator engages with one idea before deploying the eye roll. Each choose one framework—astrology, personality test, family pattern—and discuss what fits and what absolutely does not.','Skepticism and stardust granted equal seating.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('LOVE-18','mercury_is_doing_too_much','MERCURY IS DOING TOO MUCH','A sign or placement has started explaining away choices, predicting failure, or assigning traits the actual person disputes.','A chart can start a conversation; it cannot overrule testimony. The Court returns responsibility to the humans currently making decisions.','The chart-user replaces one label with an observable behavior and request. The labeled partner answers the behavior without mocking the belief system. Ban “you only do that because you’re a…” for one week; use “when X happens, I feel Y” instead.','The planets are excused from couple’s counsel. ---','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('LOVE-19','same_calendar_language','SAME CALENDAR LANGUAGE','Your calendars and emotional significance settings are broadly synchronized. No emergency florist has been subpoenaed.','The Court finds the ritual intact. Keep celebrating at the level that feels meaningful, not performative.','`[username A]` chooses one detail for the next celebration. `[username B]` chooses another so the ritual belongs to both people. Put the next date on a shared calendar and add one surprise neither can see.','The calendar has been cross-examined and released.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('LOVE-19','different_date_gravity','DIFFERENT DATE GRAVITY','One person treats the date as a tiny monument. The other remembers the relationship more easily than its filing number.','Forgetting a date is not automatically forgetting the person. Once its meaning is known, though, a reminder is cheaper than repeating the hurt.','The date-lover explains what the ritual represents, not just that it was missed. The forgetful partner installs the reminder and proposes one make-up gesture without being managed through it. Decide whether you celebrate date-of, nearby weekend, or through one recurring ritual.','Romance may use notifications.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('LOVE-19','forgotten_date_remembered_hurt','FORGOTTEN DATE, REMEMBERED HURT','The problem is no longer one missed date. It is the pattern of one person carrying the remembering while the other minimizes why it matters.','A calendar mistake is repairable; dismissing the impact is what keeps the case open. The next step is ownership plus a system.','The person who missed it acknowledges the impact without “I’m just bad at dates” as a full defense. The hurt partner asks for one realistic repair instead of requiring mind-reading. Build a shared list of three meaningful dates and what each one asks from both people.','Memory outsourced; meaning retained. ---','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('LOVE-21','mutually_licensed_pet_name','MUTUALLY LICENSED PET NAME','The nickname is ridiculous, affectionate, and fully licensed by its recipient.','The Court protects consensual pet names, including those no adult should have to explain at customs.','`[username A]` uses the nickname once at exactly the right moment. `[username B]` admits what they secretly like about it. Each submit one new contender; recipient holds absolute veto power.','Dignity waived voluntarily and with affection.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('LOVE-21','limited_release','LIMITED RELEASE','The name is sweet in one setting and a public-relations incident in another.','Affection has context. The nickname may stay, but its venue contract requires revision.','The nickname-user respects the approved settings without testing the boundary for laughs. The recipient names where it is genuinely welcome so the affection still has somewhere to go. Choose private, text, friends, and public permissions for your top two names.','Limited theatrical release approved.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('LOVE-21','emergency_rebrand','EMERGENCY REBRAND','One person is emotionally attached to the nickname. Unfortunately, it is not the person being called it.','A pet name that reliably makes its owner cringe has completed its service. Sentiment may be transferred to a successor.','The user retires it immediately without one final public performance. The recipient suggests the tone they prefer—soft, funny, ordinary, or none. Hold a sixty-second naming ceremony for a replacement, with unlimited vetoes.','The former nickname enters witness protection. ---','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('LOVE-22','shared_origin_story','SHARED ORIGIN STORY','The words landed, the feeling was mutual, and the archive remains unusually well preserved.','The first speaker receives ceremonial bravery points. The relationship receives the actual prize for continuing after the dramatic reveal.','`[username A]` shares one detail they remember about `[username B]` that day. `[username B]` adds the detail the first story always leaves out. Recreate one tiny part of the early-days feeling this week.','The trophy is imaginary. The feelings are not.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('LOVE-22','one_brave_first_mover','ONE BRAVE FIRST MOVER','One person reached the sentence first. The other arrived honestly, just on a slightly different emotional loading screen.','Timing did not create a winner and a runner-up. It created one brave opening and one answer that needed its own pace.','The first speaker describes what gave them courage without using it as lifelong leverage. The second explains what was happening internally during the pause. Each say one thing you knew early and one thing you learned later.','Emotional speedrun records have been retired.','Warm, specific, lightly playful.'),
('LOVE-22','competing_archives','COMPETING ARCHIVES','Both people have brought a confident version of events, and the versions have made only limited eye contact.','Relationship memory is collaborative fiction with excellent emotional truth. The Court declines forensic reconstruction and orders a better joint edition.','Each tells the story uninterrupted in under two minutes. Each then names one detail from the other version they are willing to adopt. Write a four-sentence “official lore” version containing both memories.','Canon updated. Comment section locked. --- # Life Court','Warm, specific, lightly playful.');
